N meetings in one room
========================
I will try to take The meetings which is ending faster , so that I can allocate the next meeting , So my intution will be greedy
Isme kya kar rahe hai ki ek array list banaye hai jismein ek array bana rahe hai end, start , idx . isko phir end time ke hisab se sort kar rahe hai 

code: class Solution {
    public int maxMeetings(int start[], int end[]) {
        int cnt = 0;
        List<int[]> meetings = new ArrayList<>();
        for(int i=0;i<start.length;i++)
        {
            meetings.add(new int[]{end[i],start[i],i+1});
        }
        meetings.sort(Comparator.comparingInt(a -> a[0]));
        int lastEnd = -1;
        for(int[] m: meetings)
        {
            if(m[1]>lastEnd)
            {
                cnt++;
                lastEnd = m[0];
            }
        }
        return cnt;
    }
}